<title>USA: Hughes unit gets $5 mln laser contract.</title>
<headline>Hughes unit gets $5 mln laser contract.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Danbury Optical Systems Inc said Friday it had received a $5 million contract to supply its laser warning system to GKN Westland Helicopters Ltd of the UK.</p>
<p>The systems will be installed on the EH-101 support helicopter for the UK Royal Air Force, a statement issued by Hughes said.</p>
<p>The contract represents the first UK order for Hughes Danbury's AN/AVR-2A laser detecting sets, the company said.</p>
<p>Hughes Danbury is part of Hughes Electronics Co.</p>
